libgcc: arm: M-profile Linux (native RP2350 ATRANS programs)

No kuser helpers exist there: the __sync_* helpers use ldrex/strex (and a
process-wide spinlock for 64-bit, as ARMv7-M has no ldrexd), and the
unwinder's VFP/iWMMXt save/restore routines are empty for soft-float M
profile instead of coprocessor instructions.

